    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_hungoff_operand_traits" kindref="compound">HungoffOperandTraits</ref> - determine the allocation regime of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">Use</ref> array when it is not a prefix to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref> object, but allocated at an unrelated heap address. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the traits class that is needed when the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">Use</ref> array must be resizable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
